Z||000002||Formula88||09-21-2001||12:51 PM||||I've always heard "Engine Strut" was the correct term for a dog bone.  Is that right?||||reg||5
Z||000003||theogre||09-21-2001||07:52 PM||||"Right" name on that is Torque Reaction Strut/Shock. Tell him to try regular parts stores and look under variations on that name. I was able to get one a couple years a go thru pep boys for my 4 cyl. I think the same company makes the V6 one. It will likely have to be ordered.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif"> <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
